        "## 3. Pix2PixHD — architecture and training\n",
        "\n",
        "In the following cells we import and configure `pix2pixHD`, adjusting options to work without instance maps (this variant is proposed as an improvement over the Pix2Pix baseline used in Task 1). `Pix2PixHD` incorporates multi-scale generators and discriminators and additional losses (feature matching, optional VGG perceptual loss) designed to improve realism and fine details in synthesized images.\n",
        "\n",
        "This implementation keeps the original repository interface but simplifies the pipeline: we do not use instance maps in the evaluated variant (opt.no_instance = True)."
