    "# Task 2 - Pix2PixHD: improvement over the Pix2Pix baseline\n",
    "\n",
    "**Computer Vision II — Master in Artificial Intelligence (2025/2026)**\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook implements and evaluates an improved version of the image-to-image translation approach used in Task 1. Instead of the `Pix2Pix` baseline (U-Net + 70x70 PatchGAN) we test `Pix2PixHD` — an architecture designed for higher-resolution synthesis and increased realism. The goal is to propose and test improvements to the baseline model and compare metrics with Task 1.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Translation direction:** `label map (binary nuclei mask)  →  realistic histology image`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Main pipeline:\n",
    "1. Load and process the MoNuSeg dataset (each PNG contains: left = real image, right = binary mask).\n",
    "2. Split into train / val / test (70 / 15 / 15).\n",
    "3. Implement and train `Pix2PixHD` as an improvement over the baseline (without instance maps in this variant).\n",
    "4. Evaluate with objective metrics and compare with Task 1.\n",
    "\n",
    "Tasks addressed in this notebook:\n",
    "1. Propose or apply at least one improvement: alternative architectures, loss functions, data augmentations, or transfer learning.\n",
    "2. Train the selected model (Pix2PixHD).\n",
    "3. Compute performance metrics and compare with Task 1.\n"
   ]
