    "## 5. Evaluation on the test set\n",
    "\n",
    "We evaluate the trained `Pix2PixHD` model on the test set using the metrics employed in Task 1 to facilitate comparison:\n",
    "\n",
    "* **L1** (mean absolute error in `[0, 1]`) — lower is better.\n",
    "* **PSNR** (Peak Signal-to-Noise Ratio) — higher is better.\n",
    "* **SSIM** (Structural Similarity Index) — higher is better.\n",
    "* **FID** (Fréchet Inception Distance) — lower is better; it captures perceptual realism.\n",
    "\n",
    "We also save the metrics to JSON to compare with Task 1 results (see the summary section at the end)."
   ]
